{
  "id": "1CO.6",
  "number": "6",
  "bookId": "1CO",
  "reference": "1 Abakorinzo 6",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CO 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obusitaachi imbeli wababula obusuubili",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu yesi khwinywe oufunaana likhuwa nowashie, yakhatsaalikha okhumusitaaka imbeli wa abo ababula obulunjishi, ne naramwinjilila imbeli wabatakatifu ta? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata shimumanyile mbu abatakatifu baliyaasia eshialo? Ne eshialo nishiba nishiliyaasibwa nineenywe, shimukwanile okhwahukhasia ebiina ebitiiti? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shimumanyile mbu khuliyaasia abamalaika? Ne shikhulashila muno okhuyaasia akomubulamu buno? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nimuba nimukhoyile okhuyaasia akomubulamu buno, mureetsangaho abo ababula oluyali mukanisa babe abayaasii noho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emboola endio okhumufwimbia emirwe. Khane nolwa kali, mbu mwinywe abulaho kata omundu mulala omuchesi owakhanyala okhwahukhasia amakhuwa hakari wabaana babwe ta? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habula mbu omundu ayaalana nomwana wabwe, imbeli wabarasuubila ta? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbula, habwenaho mumalile okhuhulwa, olwa muyaalananga murio. Shibwakhaba obulayi nimufuchiilila okhukholelwa akarali habwene ta? Shibwakhaba obulayi nimufuchiilila okhukatswa ebindu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa inywe abeene mukholanga akarali habwene ta, khandi mukatsanga; ne mukholelanga kata abaana beenywe murio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata shimumanyile mbu ababula obulunjishi shibalilaamilwa obwami bwaNyasaye ta? Mureekaatia ta; mbu abasooti shibalilaamilwa obwami bwaNyasaye ta, kata abeenamila ebifwanani, kata abaheyi, kata abeelaasi, kata abatanyana, kata abeebi, kata abalangukhu, kata abameesi, kata abanyechi, kata abanuuli tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne abandi khwinywe mwalinji murio; ne inywe mwoosibwa, khandi mwaahulwa, khandi mwabasilibwa obulunjishi muliira liOmwami Yesu Kristo, khandi muRoho waNyasaye weefwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okhuheelesia Nyasaye oluyali mumubilikwo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebindu biosi bifuchiililwa khwisie; ne shibili biosi ebili nobukhoonyi ta. Biosi bifuchiililwa khwisie; ne shifuchiilila okhurukwa neshindu shiosi ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebiliibwa biliho khulwa inda, khandi inda yiliho khulwa ebiliibwa; ne Nyasaye alibiakamia biosi, inda nende ebiliibwa. Ne omubili shikuliho khulwa obuheyi ta, habula khulwa Omwami; khandi Omwami aliho khulwa omubili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Nyasaye yamulamusia Omwami mukhufwa, khandi alikhulamusia ifwe ario khulwa obunyalibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khane shimumanyile mbu emibili chieenywe nebiungo biaKristo? Nasi kho embukule ebiungo biaKristo nimbikhol ebiungo biomutamba noho? 'A, nahatuutu ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata shimumanyile mbu owungasibwa khumutamba aba ninaye omubili mulala? Okhuba yasunga mbu Abo bombi balaba omubili mulala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne owungasibwa khuMwami aba ninaye roho ndala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwihaanye obuheyi. Buli shionoono eshia omundu akhola shibeetsanga elwanyi womubilikwe; ne ouheya yoonoonela omubili kukwe omwene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata shimumanyile mbu omubili kweenywe neihekalu yaRoho Omutakatifu ouli mwinywe, owa mwaheebwa nende Nyasaye? Kata inywe shimuli emiandu chieenywe abeene ta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okhuba mwakulwa obukusiikho mumuheelesie Nyasaye oluyali mumubili kweenywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
